674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vE3NTbiIGqMQ7kNvwEY7aJ0&_nc_oc=AdpSSK-dkgCW3_0y55FzqofHD87ZCQY014S5PIZhmGP3NKckxpXOhTUJ2nKgoEfaAiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_wSLCPk2WDTWjLw-Rp4Auxra0XvM6Cx_YV-YK1q8L0bA&oe=6A32AFD9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oy3gudyltIsQ7kNvwGjtNDK&_nc_oc=AdrylgZB530vUc72Hqf6mujwGgS8ri2yG1kFEhnipWXkOTm3SDDJvlnP-t8r7Qp2mzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_e9WA2Y08cLJQ_3jR3d4sAOsnUW9tF_vvFE2bpcWBmFQ&oe=6A32B896"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=99JeE3kpAIEQ7kNvwGwoSbf&_nc_oc=Ado8yjlghqQ39RdUXPd5MXUMkczc_8loARyHQ_Y04tfpc-VZ0vDr2kWU9Njvj0X3bMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8lqapl-g9x_HedHcgh0UsO_v-nwvYS7FOU_NtSkS7guw&oe=6A32B4B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip